## What We Are Building
The episode timeline («аниматор») is one unified module for video + reference per shot. This session
closed a long string of Director-driven refinements so each shot cell is alive (pulses while an agent
works), shows the RIGHT frame live (no stale frozen contract), and the hover-kebab gives full per-shot
control (ref plan, ref versions, video versions, approve). Plus: trial Opus 4.8 for Полина, make EREF
«tonns of fails» legible, and replace the Metelka canon text body.

