## What Did NOT Work (and why)
- **`empty_only` payload field** — red herring; not read anywhere in code. EREF fail cause was the swallowed
  provider error + no-op-as-failure, not this flag.
- **Editing Metelka WITHOUT confirming the field** — `content`=short RU paragraph, `description`=«# Metelka»
  stub, the structured Силуэт/Лицо/Visual-Canon-Notes card with «inverted teardrop / no facial features»
  lives only in `metadata.description_history` (English EXEC-BIBLE-AUTHOR card). Data didn't match the
  Director's first task wording → asked q1, he returned the exact verbatim text to write into `content`.
- **tsx top-level await** — esbuild «cjs» format rejects it; wrap rebuild scripts in `(async()=>{})()`.
- **supabase JS `.ilike('id', ...)` on uuid column** — uuid type doesn't ilike; query by file_type/filename instead.

