## Decisions Made
- **Live frame resolution > re-rebuilding the animatic** — the frozen contract goes stale on every new
  approval (whack-a-mole). Resolve the frame live; frozen contract is now last-resort fallback only.
- **Tint (bg) for ref-presence, NOT number colour** — number = video status/live-pulse; ref presence is an
  orthogonal axis → `--asset-image` bg tint (distinct from green/orange/blue/violet).
- **Two-state ✓** — muted outline = action (REVIEW→approve), bright solid = state (APPROVED). Respects
  legal status transitions (only REVIEW→APPROVED direct).
- **Opus via Anthropic OpenAI-compat, not native SDK** — reuses the whole concierge tool-loop (subtractive).
- **Metelka: edit `content` (live card body) verbatim** — Director confirmed the field + gave exact text.

